From: Persona4-PC host adapter maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Analysis: include the header that declares std::abs(int)

Luau 0.744, commit 32c28089305f488f901aaf1dbf3fd1cb65fa3d11.
libc++ 23 (llvm-mingw 20261006) no longer provides the integer std::abs
through unrelated transitive headers. No behavioral or ABI change.

--- a/third_party/luau/Analysis/src/TableLiteralInference.cpp
+++ b/third_party/luau/Analysis/src/TableLiteralInference.cpp
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include "Luau/ToString.h"
 #include "Luau/TypeUtils.h"
 #include "Luau/Unifier2.h"
+#include <cstdlib>
 
 LUAU_FASTFLAGVARIABLE(LuauBidirectionalInferenceBetterLambdaHandling)
 
